  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Private Pool - Walk to Seaside - Public Beach - 2 Minute Bike Ride - `Dogwood Daze`<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>🌴Spacious 5BR/5.5BA Beach House + Carriage House (Sleeps 16!)<br><br><br><br>✨QUICK HIGHLIGHTS:<br><br><br><br>✔ Private Pool (Heat Optional) – Enjoy a swim in your own oasis<br><br>✔ Newer Construction – Modern, high-end finishes throughout<br><br>✔ Expansive Outdoor Living – Huge patios, porches, and balconies<br><br>✔ 3 Indoor Living Areas – Plenty of space to relax & entertain<br><br>✔ 6 Complimentary Bikes – Explore 30A in style<br><br>✔ Ping Pong Table – Fun for all ages!<br><br>✔ 6-Seater Golf Cart Rental Option – Cruise to Seaside & beyond<br><br>✔ Professionally Managed, 24/7 Service – Stress-free vacationing<br><br>✔ Driveway Parking for 3 Vehicles – Private & convenient<br><br><br><br>🏠Welcome to Dogwood Daze<br><br><br><br>Just one street over from Seaside and only a few houses up from the beach, 239 Dogwood is a spacious 5 bedroom/ 5.5 bath beach house that can accommodate 14 comfortably. With the addition of the carriage house, this home will sleep 16! This centrally located new construction offers private parking, a gorgeous front porch balcony and huge back patio with pool!<br><br><br><br>As you make your way into the home you will be greeted by the spacious living room, kitchen, and dining room. This brand-new kitchen has everything you need. Stainless steel appliances, granite counter tops and a gas range are just a few of the highlights of this gorgeous kitchen. The huge dining table has seating for 10-12 with an additional 5 seats at the eat in bar!<br><br>The cozy living room will be just what your family needs to relax and unwind after a long day at the beach.<br><br>Also, on the first floor you will find one of the many master bedrooms with King sized bed and en suite bathroom with walk in shower.<br><br><br><br>The patio off the kitchen is complete with a large dining table and direct access to the homes private heated pool!<br><br><br><br>Head on up the gorgeous set of stairs onto the second floor. This floor has three bedrooms including a master bedroom with king sized bed and private en suite bathroom. This master bedroom has a porch that overlooks the pool. The second master on this floor also has a king-sized bed and en suite bath. There is also a balcony off this bedroom as well! The third and final bedroom is a bunk room with two sets of twin over two queen beds with a shared bath.<br><br>The second floor also boasts a second living area with couches, TV and a huge balcony with porch swing and seating area.<br><br><br><br>One more flight of stairs will take you to the master bedroom oasis. On this floor you will find a HUGE master suite with King sized bed, huge bathroom with separate soaking tub and walk in shower and double vanity. The third floor also has a living area with cozy sofas, a wet bar, and a huge balcony. The balcony has plenty of seating and a ping pong table.<br><br><br><br>Spend your vacation at this gorgeous brand-new home and make memories that will last your family a lifetime!<br><br><br><br><br><br>House Rules<br><br>**No Pets!**<br><br>**No Smoking!**<br><br>**No Parties!**<br><br>**The primary renter must be at least 25 years old**<br><br>**No units will be rented to vacationing students or young adults under 25 unaccompanied by a responsible parent or guardian at a ratio of three (3) children/young adults to one (1) adult over the age of 25**<br><br>**30A Vacay rental agreement is required to be signed prior to arrival**<br><br><br><br><br><br>Pool Heat<br><br>*Pool heating available for this property from October 1st through May 1st<br><br>*Fee $50 per day and required for length of stay<br><br>*Pool heat is not guaranteed-please note pool and hot tub cannot be heated at the same time.<br><br>*Please choose to heat one option; pool or hot tub for your stay.<br><br><br><br>*No Cable. Streaming Only**<br><br><br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (16):<br><br>1st floor - Master Bedroom - King sized bed, en suite bathroom with walk in shower<br><br>2nd floor - Master Bedroom - King sized bed, en suite bathroom with walk in shower<br><br>2nd floor - Master Bedroom - King sized bed, en suite bathroom with stand-up shower<br><br>2nd floor - Bunk room - 1 bunk, twin over twin bed, 1 bunk, queen over queen bed, shared bath with tub/shower combination<br><br>3rd floor - Main Master - King sized bed, en suite bathroom with separate soaking tub and walk in shower<br><br>Carriage house - Master - King sized bed, private bathroom<br><br>Carriage House - sleeper sofa in living room<br><br><br><br>AREA ATTRACTIONS:<br><br>Discover the charm of Seagrove, a beach neighborhood that locals and guests love. Lush oak trees, magnolias, and pines have spread deep roots in Seagrove — and so have long-time visitors who keep coming back.<br><br>Laid-back but luxurious, Seagrove is a place that embraces variety. From upscale boutiques to casual cafes, this beach neighborhood offers a little bit of everything — including two rare coastal dune lakes, a state park, and sugar-white sand. Pack a picnic, fishing pole, and binoculars — and witness how stunning Seagrove is in its all-natural state. Its sugar-white sand has been a peaceful retreat in South Walton for decades; here, old and new Gulf Coast style merge to create a charming beach neighborhood with everything one may need for a truly relaxing getaway.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
