        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We have rented large houses in Seagrove and Seaside for fifteen years now and this was the best and most open and comfortable spaces we have ever been in. The main level has a great primary King suite and a huge kitchen and living room and dining room that was perfect for us to hang out--then the next two levels have their own sitting rooms for getting away from everything to relax. We will be back and this was the best year we have had in Seaside and it is because of Dogwood Daze!",
